      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Added explicit first-run privacy consent before tracking begins.</li>
          <li>Added complete project editing, archive, restore, and confirmed deletion.</li>
          <li>Redesigned Projects and Focus Session history as scalable Arel ledgers.</li>
          <li>Added detailed reports for apps, websites, projects, and Focus Sessions.</li>
          <li>Added complete local-data export and safer shutdown persistence.</li>
          <li>Added secure in-app update checks and universal Intel and Apple Silicon builds.</li>
        </ul>
